<h2>泊位理赔证据</h2>{% if signed %}<p>泊位分钟勾稽差额 <b>{{ signed.minutes_balance }}</b></p><p>证据摘要 <code>{{ signed.sha256 }}</code></p>{% if signed.manifest.parent %}<p>原清算批次 <a href="/clearing/appeal?key={{ signed.manifest.parent }}"><code>{{ signed.manifest.parent[:18] }}</code></a></p>{% endif %}{% if signed.manifest.reclaimed %}<div class="tablebox"><table><thead><tr><th>认回回执</th><th>金额</th><th>原停靠</th><th>补扫后停靠</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in signed.manifest.reclaimed %}<tr><td>{{ row.receipt }}</td><td>{{ yuan(row.cents) }}</td><td><code>{{ row.parent_stay[:12] }}</code></td><td><code>{{ row.new_stay[:12] }}</code></td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div>{% endif %}{% if signed.manifest.disputed %}<p>仍有争议 {% for row in signed.manifest.disputed %}{{ row.receipt }}（{{ label.get(row.reason,row.reason) }}）{% if not loop.last %}、{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>{% endif %}<a class="download" href="/api/export/{{ key }}">下载逐单理赔证据</a>{% else %}<p>先运行清算再签发。</p>{% endif %}
